        {
          "text": "Jewe Uhoraho nari nakwise igiti ca elayo kiremvye giteye igomwe, kirikw imyelayo myiza: noneho naragituriye, har’ urwamo rw’ akarūru kenshi, kand’ amashami yaco arahimbaguritse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
