            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko jewe Uhoraho Nyen’ ingabo nari narakubaditse, ari jewe nyene nkugeneye ivyago, kubg’ ibibi vyakozwe n’ab’ inzu ya Isirayeli n’ab’ inzu ya Yuda, ivyo bakoze vyo kundatsa, mu kwosereza Bayali imibavu.",
          "type": "text",
