        {
          "text": "Ariko nari mmeze nk’umwagazi w’intama w’ikirīga ujanwa kubāgwa; sinari nzi yuko bampigiye imihigo, bat’ Enda turandurane igiti n’ivyo camye, tumukūre mw isi y’abakiriho, kugira ngw izina ryiwe ntiribe ricibukwa ukundi. ",
